            "69011602": {
              "title": "",
              "desc": "· When Miasmic Fiend is affected by <color=#FFAF2C>Attribute Anomaly</color>, it takes 8% bonus Anomaly DMG from Agents, stacking up to 6 times; activating <Term:2000002>Miasmic Shield</Term> clears all stacks, with each stack increasing the reduction efficiency of <color=#FFAF2C>Miasmic Shield</color> by 2.5%."
